     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<ul class=\"d2u-list\"><li><strong>FAA Regulations</strong><br>Airspace, waivers, and the rules that keep you and your gear compliant.</li><li><strong>Flight Technique</strong><br>Manual and GPS-assisted flying, smooth camera moves, and recovery skills.</li><li><strong>Aerial Photo & Video</strong><br>Exposure, framing, and cinematic camera moves from the air.</li><li><strong>Mapping & Surveying</strong><br>Photogrammetry workflows for construction, real estate, and land use.</li><li><strong>Part 107 Prep</strong><br>Direct preparation for the FAA Remote Pilot certification test.</li></ul>"
